Database Security

Created and configured SQL Server logins and database users.

Implemented role-based access control using db_owner and db_datareader.

Validated permissions through practical access-control tests.

Configured Mixed Mode Authentication.

Database Encryption

Implemented Transparent Data Encryption (TDE) using AES-256.

Configured column-level encryption using AES-256 symmetric keys.

Demonstrated data encryption and decryption.
